  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C20C959C9FC7CFAF",
      "text": "欢迎来到深钵道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C20C969C9FC7D162",
      "text": "我要登记一下\\n挑战者的名字……\\r\\n你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C20C979C9FC7D315",
      "text": "想和本道馆的\\n馆主寇沙对战，\\r\\n需要先通过道馆测验才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "C20C909C9FC7C730",
      "text": "深钵道馆的道馆测验是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]收集向日花怪[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_history",
      "hash64": "A60C21835437EBCC",
      "text": "深钵是艺术之镇……\\c\\n人们对能够成为作品主题的“自然”\\n以及孕育自然的“太阳”心怀感恩。\\c\\n因此，这里有收集兼具这两个要素的\\n向日花怪并款待它们的风俗习惯。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "C20C919C9FC7C8E3",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，希望你能在深钵镇\\n找出又像太阳又像花儿的宝可梦，\\r\\n也就是向日花怪。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "C20C929C9FC7CA96",
      "text": "如果你能收集[VAR 0x0201(0001)]只，\\n并把它们带到向日花怪广场的话，\\r\\n就能通过道馆测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_map",
      "hash64": "830B93225E20E9E2",
      "text": "首先要把向日花怪广场的位置\\n添加到地图上。\\c\\n具体事宜请你去问\\n那边的工作人员吧。\\c\\n从道馆出去后往右边一走就到！\\n把向日花怪的巨大摆设当做目标吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_kusa_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "C20C939C9FC7CC49",
      "text": "好了，快去吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
